<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#101A16" />
    <title>@ViewData["Title"] · Llave</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="~/img/llave-mark.svg" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:opsz,wght@12..96,500;12..96,700&family=Onest:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/llave.css" asp-append-version="true" />
</head>
<body>
    <div class="shell">
        <aside class="brand-panel">
            <a class="brand" asp-page="/Index">
                <img src="~/img/llave-mark.svg" alt="" />
                <span class="brand-name">Llave</span>
            </a>

            <div class="brand-copy">
                <h2>Del anuncio a la entrega de la <em>llave</em>.</h2>
                <p>Publica inmuebles, acuerda visitas y recibe un aviso en cada paso.</p>
            </div>

            <p class="brand-footer">Arriendo y venta de vivienda</p>
        </aside>

        <main class="auth">
            <div class="auth-card">
                @RenderBody()
            </div>

            <p class="auth-footer">Tus datos se tratan conforme a la Ley 1581 de 2012 de protección de datos personales.</p>
        </main>
    </div>

    <script>
        document.querySelectorAll("[data-toggle-password]").forEach(button => {
            const input = document.getElementById(button.dataset.togglePassword);
            button.addEventListener("click", () => {
                const hidden = input.type === "password";
                input.type = hidden ? "text" : "password";
                button.textContent = hidden ? "Ocultar" : "Mostrar";
                button.setAttribute("aria-pressed", hidden);
            });
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
